data: {"id": "f1d8e52bffe049d1-thinking-parallel_evidence-790", "run_id": "f1d8e52bffe049d1", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据 `kubectl_describe`、`kubectl_get_yaml` 和节点状态的真实结果，我现在可以明确根因了：\n\n## 根因结论：调度约束不匹配（Node Affinity/Selector 不匹配）\n\n**直接证据：**\n\n1.  **事件原文 (FailedScheduling)**：\n    *   `0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.`\n    *   这条消息反复出现了多次（41分钟前首次，之后每6分钟重复），证明调度器在尝试了集群内所有 3 个节点后，都因为调度约束不匹配而拒绝调度。\n\n2.  **Pod 定义 (nodeSelector)**：\n    *   `nodeSelector: {\"aiops.lab/unavailable\": \"true\"}`\n    *   Pod 要求调度到所有节点上带有标签 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` 的节点。\n\n3.  **节点状态**：\n    *   集群内有 3 ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788762793713, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

